  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This cooperative agreement between USADF and Diamond Development Initiatives allows for the development, implementation, monitoring, and evaluation of USADF&apos;s programmatic activities in Nigeria. Funds are used to pay staff salaries, program monitoring expenses, office and vehicle expenses, annual auditing, capacity building, and other small administrative items.</narrative>
